@startuml dictionary-resource-adapter
' Snapshot-pinned dictionary provider flow.
' Palette: docs/diagrams/README.md — lling #FCF3CF, foreign provider #FFCDD2,
' resource handle #DCEDC8, validation #E1BEE7, caller #ECEFF1.
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #607D8B
  LifeLineBorderColor #455A64
  GroupBorderColor #455A64
  GroupBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #E1BEE7
  BorderColor #6A1B9A
}

title <b>ResourceDictionary — capture once, search with explicit semantics</b>\n<size:11><i>no complete key copy; failures and normalization mismatches remain observable</i></size>

actor "Rust application" as App #ECEFF1
participant "libdictenstein or\nhost provider" as Provider #FFCDD2
participant "VtResource" as Resource #DCEDC8
participant "ResourceDictionary" as Adapter #FCF3CF
participant "ResourceTransducer" as Search #FCF3CF
participant "EditDistanceLayer" as Layer #FCF3CF

== Construction ==
App -> Provider : resource()
Provider --> Resource : one owned retain
App -> Adapter : from_resource_with_normalization(resource, policy)
activate Adapter
Adapter -> Search : validate Unicode domain + retain
Search -> Provider : snapshot()
Provider --> Search : immutable revision
Search -> Provider : len()
Provider --> Search : known count or unknown
Adapter --> App : pinned adapter
deactivate Adapter

== One bounded correction query ==
App -> Layer : find_corrections(input)
activate Layer
Layer -> Layer : validate finite non-negative costs\nselect Levenshtein or OSA metric
Layer -> Adapter : find_within_distance(input, bound, limit, normalization)
activate Adapter
alt case-insensitive request over exact resource
  Adapter --> Layer : UnsupportedNormalization
else admitted request
  Adapter -> Adapter : normalize query only when\nUnicodeLowercaseKeys was declared
  Adapter -> Search : with_algorithm(metric)\n(shared snapshot; no provider retain)
  loop pages until limit or exhaustion
    Search -> Provider : bounded snapshot traversal
    Provider --> Search : ordered match page
  end
  Search --> Adapter : distance-then-term matches
  Adapter --> Layer : at most requested limit
end
deactivate Adapter
Layer -> Layer : minimum weighted edit cost\n+ exact-match boost
Layer --> App : corrections or typed LayerError
deactivate Layer

note over Resource,Search
  Dropping the producer or borrowed resource does not invalidate
  the adapter: its captured snapshot owns the required retain.
end note

legend right
  |<#FCF3CF> lling-llang / liblevenshtein consumer |
  |<#FFCDD2> provider callback boundary |
  |<#DCEDC8> retained resource ownership |
  |<#E1BEE7> validation and semantic guard |
  |<#ECEFF1> application |
endlegend
@enduml
